==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Hinox Guts are dropped by all three varieties of [[Hinox]]es when defeated. As is the case with other [[Monster Part]]s, they can be [[Cooking|cooked]] in a [[Cooking Pot]] with critters to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used to make Yellow [[Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] or exchanged for [[Mon]] with [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]].

Hinox Guts are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Hinox Guts}}

